From df7eeb851f6a33ce2722405d0c25d0d08e680d0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wei-Luan Wang <weiluanwang@google.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Jun 2025 02:59:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Use non-boringssl md5 sha1 implementation.

Libchrome does not support boringssl. Add back the non-boringssl implementation
in upstream Chromium, the md5_nacl and sha1_nacl, which was removed in
crrev.com/c/6658300 and crrev.com/c/6655692.

Change-Id: I82e14ea2a001fdb435da9aa813379191aec8d4f4
patch-name: long-term-0600-Use-non-boringssl-md5-sha1-implementation.patch
---
